WEBVTT

00:00:02.660 --> 00:00:05.970
And? What is the name of the nuisance?

00:00:06.920 --> 00:00:09.340
She calls herself Mew Strawberry.

00:00:09.340 --> 00:00:10.640
Is that so…

00:00:11.090 --> 00:00:12.610
The true identity is still unknown.

00:00:13.630 --> 00:00:16.220
I cannot forgive the species known as humans…

00:00:16.220 --> 00:00:20.360
…who soil this beautiful planet and think they are owner of it.

00:00:21.020 --> 00:00:23.560
And now they are going against us.

00:00:23.560 --> 00:00:25.390
Destroy them immediately.

00:00:25.390 --> 00:00:28.840
I have come up with a plan regarding that case.

00:00:33.240 --> 00:00:34.950
Inside these…

00:00:34.950 --> 00:00:39.750
the DNA of the animals of this planet are condensed.

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:47.330
If we combine this with the source of life – Spirit, that we take out of the humans…

00:00:47.330 --> 00:00:51.480
It is possible to create a more powerful Chimera Anima.

00:00:52.300 --> 00:00:54.010
Get onto it right away.

00:00:54.010 --> 00:00:54.810
Roger!

00:01:02.180 --> 00:01:03.140
Ichigo!

00:01:03.140 --> 00:01:04.790
Hey, Ichigo!

00:01:10.520 --> 00:01:11.770
Good morning, Ichigo.

00:01:11.770 --> 00:01:12.570
Hey!

00:01:14.110 --> 00:01:18.570
You’re acting like a weak sponge.

00:01:18.570 --> 00:01:20.510
Get dressed quickly,
you’re going to be late.

00:01:20.510 --> 00:01:22.960
Be late? For what?

00:01:24.040 --> 00:01:27.000
We’re going to grandpa’s place to go see the festival, remember?

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:29.980
Sorry dad, I have something
to do today.

00:01:31.460 --> 00:01:32.840
What?!

00:01:32.840 --> 00:01:35.590
It’s the festival! It’s fabulous!

00:01:35.590 --> 00:01:38.010
Ichigo’s busy lately.

00:01:38.010 --> 00:01:42.350
Screw that! Think over it, Ichigo.

00:01:42.350 --> 00:01:45.020
Stop talking like that!

00:01:45.020 --> 00:01:45.870
What did you say?!

00:01:46.640 --> 00:01:49.110
I would understand if you’re a sushi chef or fish shop owner,

00:01:49.110 --> 00:01:52.090
but you’re just a normal worker!

00:01:52.090 --> 00:01:53.090
It doesn’t match you!

00:01:53.730 --> 00:01:55.010
Screw that, fool!

00:01:55.820 --> 00:01:58.330
I’m a pure Tokyoite!

00:02:01.270 --> 00:02:04.620
I don’t need a kid telling me
how to talk!

00:02:04.620 --> 00:02:07.120
Mom, say something.

00:02:07.120 --> 00:02:09.760
Why? Darling’s cool!

00:02:25.930 --> 00:02:27.310
Hey, Minto!

00:02:27.310 --> 00:02:28.770
Yes?

00:02:28.770 --> 00:02:31.730
We’re going to open soon, help out with the preparation.

00:02:31.730 --> 00:02:33.130
Oh? But I am.

00:02:33.130 --> 00:02:33.880
Doing what?

00:02:37.780 --> 00:02:40.650
I’m tasting today’s special tea.

00:02:40.650 --> 00:02:42.850
It has quite an elegant taste.

00:02:45.160 --> 00:02:47.180
Ichigo-san, I will do the preparation…

00:02:49.520 --> 00:02:51.920
No! That’s not the problem!

00:02:51.920 --> 00:02:54.230
Did you all finish cleaning the outside of the store?

00:02:54.230 --> 00:02:56.380
Uhh, not yet.

00:02:56.380 --> 00:02:57.800
Then… Ichigo!

00:02:57.800 --> 00:02:58.450
N-Nooooo!

00:02:59.170 --> 00:03:01.880
Wait Shirogane, it’s Sunday isn’t it?

00:03:01.880 --> 00:03:02.970
So?

00:03:02.970 --> 00:03:04.970
Don’t “So?” me!

00:03:04.970 --> 00:03:08.660
Why do I have to help out this store on a day off?!

00:03:09.390 --> 00:03:11.070
You don’t have to…

00:03:11.600 --> 00:03:14.900
But you won’t get to have
all-you-can-eat cakes, period.

00:03:15.900 --> 00:03:17.550
I can’t lose that privilege…

00:03:18.440 --> 00:03:19.740
Clean it good.

00:03:24.950 --> 00:03:27.630
I can’t fight against those words…

00:03:28.120 --> 00:03:30.130
Let’s do our best, Ichigo-san.

00:03:31.080 --> 00:03:34.190
You’re always so optimistic, Retasu.

00:03:34.190 --> 00:03:36.220
Do your best! Do your best!

00:03:37.040 --> 00:03:39.260
And you’re always carefree…

00:03:41.010 --> 00:03:41.900
Huh??

00:03:56.230 --> 00:03:58.520
What should we do?
She’s asking something.

00:03:58.520 --> 00:04:00.400
Y-Yes, she is…

00:04:00.400 --> 00:04:02.550
Eerr, I-I am… “a Ichigo”

00:04:03.150 --> 00:04:05.680
You don’t put an “a” in front of your name…

00:04:07.160 --> 00:04:08.780
E-errr… Strawberry!

00:04:08.780 --> 00:04:09.710
OK?

00:04:11.910 --> 00:04:13.300
…I’ll go call someone!!

00:04:13.870 --> 00:04:15.020
WAIT, Retasu!

00:04:21.130 --> 00:04:22.050
Aaaaaaaa…

00:04:22.050 --> 00:04:23.240
…this is a pen!!!

00:04:28.470 --> 00:04:29.810
Ugghh. Yes yes…

00:04:29.810 --> 00:04:30.750
Aaaa, NO NO!

00:04:31.180 --> 00:04:33.860
Nyaaaa!! I don’t understand!!

00:04:35.440 --> 00:04:36.880
Hi, Momomiya-san.

00:04:38.730 --> 00:04:41.090
Um, there’s an emergency outside.

00:04:41.610 --> 00:04:44.240
Did Ichigo do something again?

00:04:44.240 --> 00:04:46.160
It’s not like that…

00:04:46.160 --> 00:04:47.620
Is something the matter?

00:04:47.620 --> 00:04:48.720
Well…

00:04:49.950 --> 00:04:51.140
Aoyama-kun!

00:04:51.870 --> 00:04:53.290
What’s the matter?

00:04:53.290 --> 00:04:54.750
Urmm you see…

00:04:54.750 --> 00:04:57.080
I’m helping out in that shop.

00:04:57.080 --> 00:04:58.710
Is that so?

00:04:58.710 --> 00:05:00.840
So what brings you here,
Aoyama-kun?

00:05:00.840 --> 00:05:02.890
I was taking a walk since the weather is nice.

00:05:07.640 --> 00:05:10.120
W-Wuaahhh Aoyama-kun, help me!

00:05:22.860 --> 00:05:25.300
Aoyama-kun is amazing.

00:05:37.080 --> 00:05:39.580
This person is Ms. Mary McGwire.

00:05:39.580 --> 00:05:43.030
She’s looking for a person named Ryou Shirogane.

00:05:57.890 --> 00:06:00.580
His attitude is different from usual…

00:06:07.220 --> 00:06:08.800
Don’t skip out of cleaning.

00:06:13.080 --> 00:06:15.700
That kind of pisses me off…

00:06:15.700 --> 00:06:16.480
Momomiya-san?

00:06:17.540 --> 00:06:19.420
Is he your friend?

00:06:22.590 --> 00:06:25.000
These two are my friends.

00:06:25.000 --> 00:06:28.300
Aizawa Minto-san and
Midorikawa Retasu-san.

00:06:28.300 --> 00:06:30.260
Nice to meet you, I’m Aoyama.

00:06:30.260 --> 00:06:31.050
Hello.

00:06:31.050 --> 00:06:32.390
Nice to meet you.

00:06:33.850 --> 00:06:36.500
Would you like to get inside and have some tea?

00:06:37.060 --> 00:06:38.350
Thanks.

00:06:38.350 --> 00:06:39.920
I have a club meeting I have to attend.

00:06:40.600 --> 00:06:41.850
That’s too bad.

00:06:41.850 --> 00:06:44.960
I’ve only gotten to know Ichigo’s boyfriend…

00:06:45.610 --> 00:06:46.630
BOYFRIEND?

00:06:46.630 --> 00:06:48.670
No, he’s not!

00:06:49.970 --> 00:06:54.280
I’m kind of happy. But I can’t… aaaa…

00:06:52.780 --> 00:06:54.280
Momomiya-san?

00:06:54.280 --> 00:06:56.710
Aoyama-kun waaaaaaa~

00:06:56.080 --> 00:06:57.560
I’ll be goiing now.

00:06:57.560 --> 00:06:58.590
…eh?

00:07:00.460 --> 00:07:01.750
Bye.

00:07:01.750 --> 00:07:02.760
Good luck!

00:07:05.540 --> 00:07:07.990
He’s a nice boy.

00:07:08.420 --> 00:07:10.670
R-Ri-Right…! Isn’t he?

00:07:10.670 --> 00:07:12.740
You’re not going out with him yet?

00:07:14.760 --> 00:07:17.490
I can’t tell you that.

00:07:38.910 --> 00:07:40.370
What a beautiful song!

00:07:40.370 --> 00:07:42.710
Where did that piano come from?

00:07:42.710 --> 00:07:44.290
Who cares.

00:07:44.290 --> 00:07:45.360
Listen…

00:07:46.500 --> 00:07:49.140
Yes. It’s wonderful…

00:07:53.380 --> 00:07:54.430
Bravo!

00:07:59.520 --> 00:08:03.440
Ryou said he’s going to run a party next week.

00:08:04.270 --> 00:08:08.360
So he called for her to play
at the party.

00:08:08.360 --> 00:08:09.360
Party?

00:08:09.360 --> 00:08:10.150
Yep.

00:08:10.150 --> 00:08:13.800
We would like to thank you all for helping out the store.

00:08:13.800 --> 00:08:14.790
What?

00:08:15.280 --> 00:08:19.370
We want it to be a gorgeous and elegant party.

00:08:19.370 --> 00:08:22.500
We have prepared wonderful dresses for you all.

00:08:22.500 --> 00:08:23.330
Dresses?

00:08:23.330 --> 00:08:26.520
Does that mean that Shirogane-san is going to be the host?

00:08:34.470 --> 00:08:37.440
That guy… might be a better person than I thought.

00:08:42.560 --> 00:08:43.270
She’s coming!

00:08:43.270 --> 00:08:46.110
NOooo! I can’t speak English!

00:08:52.370 --> 00:08:52.880
What?

00:08:53.690 --> 00:09:00.330
“I’d love to play the piano for pretty girls like you”

00:09:01.040 --> 00:09:03.400
Pretty? Thanks…

00:09:09.460 --> 00:09:10.710
She…

00:09:10.710 --> 00:09:12.880
…has the charm of an adult.

00:09:12.880 --> 00:09:15.450
Ryou is in love with her performance.

00:09:17.430 --> 00:09:19.350
He says he feels a pure spirit.

00:09:20.430 --> 00:09:21.940
I feel the same way.

00:09:32.940 --> 00:09:34.590
So you like boys like him…?

00:09:36.570 --> 00:09:38.450
What are you talking about!?

00:09:38.450 --> 00:09:39.530
Am I wrong?

00:09:39.530 --> 00:09:41.530
You don’t know anything!

00:09:41.530 --> 00:09:42.910
Your ears… are sticking out!

00:09:42.910 --> 00:09:44.790
W-Wuah! Shut up!

00:09:45.290 --> 00:09:47.340
Here. It’s your dress.

00:09:52.130 --> 00:09:53.640
Pretty!

00:09:55.210 --> 00:09:57.890
That’s what a strawberry
color is, right?

00:10:06.230 --> 00:10:07.080
How is it?

00:10:10.770 --> 00:10:13.500
Do you believe my instinct?

00:10:14.020 --> 00:10:15.320
Yes…

00:10:15.320 --> 00:10:16.800
I always believed in you.

00:10:17.950 --> 00:10:20.790
I hope the party ends safely.

00:10:37.290 --> 00:10:39.960
What should I do? I’m starting to get nervous.

00:10:39.960 --> 00:10:41.430
Oh really?

00:10:43.090 --> 00:10:45.100
Hi, hello there.

00:10:46.590 --> 00:10:48.020
She’s used to it.

00:10:49.300 --> 00:10:50.330
It’s Ms. Mary.

00:10:55.310 --> 00:10:56.980
How beautiful…!

00:10:56.980 --> 00:10:58.220
Yes.

00:10:58.220 --> 00:11:00.170
Hey, so you all are here.

00:11:04.360 --> 00:11:05.360
Oh my!

00:11:05.360 --> 00:11:07.100
I-It looks good on you.

00:11:07.990 --> 00:11:11.250
It’s a party, so enjoy yourselves.

00:11:23.880 --> 00:11:26.130
This looks like a real dance party…

00:11:26.130 --> 00:11:27.420
It IS, a real one.

00:11:27.420 --> 00:11:29.000
Would you two care to join?

00:11:29.800 --> 00:11:30.840
I can’t!

00:11:30.840 --> 00:11:34.250
I’ve only fork danced before at the PE Festival!

00:11:35.390 --> 00:11:36.920
I’ll teach you.

00:11:36.920 --> 00:11:37.920
H-Hey!

00:11:46.030 --> 00:11:50.290
There must be someone who is compatible.

00:11:58.290 --> 00:11:59.400
Sorry!

00:12:00.030 --> 00:12:01.820
Get closer.

00:12:06.210 --> 00:12:07.280
Loosen up.

00:12:15.350 --> 00:12:18.020
Wow, I’m dancing properly!

00:12:19.560 --> 00:12:20.680
Oh no…

00:12:20.680 --> 00:12:23.680
…why is my heart pounding so fast?

00:12:41.910 --> 00:12:44.510
I’ll go outside awhile.

00:12:49.590 --> 00:12:51.040
This feels nice!

00:12:54.090 --> 00:12:55.170
Hey!

00:12:55.170 --> 00:12:56.480
Want some juice?

00:12:58.470 --> 00:12:59.730
Thank you…

00:13:00.520 --> 00:13:02.690
Umm, may I ask a question?

00:13:03.810 --> 00:13:06.390
Why did you pick this dress?

00:13:06.860 --> 00:13:09.110
Because I thought it would look good on you.

00:13:09.110 --> 00:13:10.890
If you don’t like it,
you can get changed.

00:13:11.900 --> 00:13:13.410
I don’t hate it…

00:13:16.740 --> 00:13:17.620
Wh… What?

00:13:17.620 --> 00:13:18.770
Don’t move…

00:13:24.040 --> 00:13:26.530
Your bangs…
were a little out of order.

00:13:28.000 --> 00:13:30.740
I have to go say hello to few people,

00:13:31.300 --> 00:13:33.380
so come back once you’ve
calmed down.

00:13:39.350 --> 00:13:40.760
What was that?

00:13:40.760 --> 00:13:43.230
Why was he so kind to me?

00:13:44.810 --> 00:13:49.260
Come to think of it,
I don’t know anything about him.

00:13:51.360 --> 00:13:52.600
Oh, Ms. Mary?

00:13:53.240 --> 00:13:53.900
Ms. Mary…!

00:13:53.900 --> 00:13:54.990
Good evening!

00:13:57.910 --> 00:14:01.310
Let’s do something entertaining for the party.

00:14:01.870 --> 00:14:02.820
What?

00:14:14.170 --> 00:14:15.260
Ms. Mary!

00:14:21.470 --> 00:14:25.390
If I combine a compatible person’s Spirit and this,

00:14:25.390 --> 00:14:27.510
I can create something like this!

00:14:31.110 --> 00:14:32.370
FUSION!

00:14:37.860 --> 00:14:39.730
P-i-a-n-o…!

00:14:41.580 --> 00:14:43.500
How is it? Isn’t it great?

00:14:45.620 --> 00:14:46.840
What have you done?!

00:14:48.540 --> 00:14:49.820
Now, try fighting!

00:14:56.050 --> 00:14:57.220
How unforgivable!

00:14:57.220 --> 00:14:59.210
Doing this to a person who can play such beautiful music!

00:15:02.510 --> 00:15:04.380
Masha, what’s the matter?

00:15:05.060 --> 00:15:07.840
Chimeral Anima is fighting with Ichigo!

00:15:08.640 --> 00:15:09.520
Let’s go!

00:15:09.520 --> 00:15:10.360
Yes!

00:15:11.440 --> 00:15:12.660
Ichigo-san!

00:15:14.440 --> 00:15:17.560
Everyone, that guy turned Ms. Mary
into a Chimera Anima!

00:15:17.560 --> 00:15:18.490
What?

00:15:18.490 --> 00:15:20.310
A human into a Chimera Anima!?

00:15:21.410 --> 00:15:24.070
Let’s go guys!
We have to save Ms. Mary!

00:15:25.740 --> 00:15:29.510
Mew Mew Strawberry METAMORPHO-SE!

00:16:08.660 --> 00:16:10.080
For the future of the Earth…

00:16:10.080 --> 00:16:11.530
At your service! ~Nya!

00:16:11.920 --> 00:16:13.500
My my, this looks interesting.

00:16:13.500 --> 00:16:14.920
A very nice entertainment.

00:16:14.920 --> 00:16:16.090
Crush them!

00:16:16.090 --> 00:16:17.790
Piaa-NO!

00:16:25.180 --> 00:16:27.180
This is Deep Blue’s will.

00:16:27.180 --> 00:16:28.800
Don’t take it personally.

00:16:29.430 --> 00:16:30.340
Deep Blue?

00:16:33.400 --> 00:16:34.260
Watch out!

00:16:35.650 --> 00:16:37.020
Thanks!

00:16:37.020 --> 00:16:39.940
That Chimera Anima is different from the ones before!

00:16:39.940 --> 00:16:41.310
I’ll go!

00:16:41.610 --> 00:16:44.040
MintonArrow!!

00:16:50.330 --> 00:16:54.780
Reborn… Mint ECHO!!

00:16:57.500 --> 00:16:58.620
I’ll go next!

00:16:59.050 --> 00:17:00.680
LettasTanets!

00:17:09.600 --> 00:17:14.720
Reborn… Lettuce RUSH!

00:17:23.780 --> 00:17:25.710
Piaaanoooh!

00:17:31.910 --> 00:17:33.460
Piaaano!

00:17:37.670 --> 00:17:39.300
I can’t breath…

00:17:40.840 --> 00:17:43.260
She became a Chimera.

00:17:43.260 --> 00:17:46.970
I can’t believe they would make a human into a Chimera Anima.

00:17:46.970 --> 00:17:49.380
No, its power is more
than we expected.

00:17:51.680 --> 00:17:53.260
What should we do, Ryou?

00:17:56.230 --> 00:17:57.480
Keiichirou!

00:17:57.480 --> 00:18:01.150
Use the intercom and play her music at max volume!

00:18:01.150 --> 00:18:01.820
Yes!

00:18:07.110 --> 00:18:08.710
Minto… Retasu…

00:18:14.120 --> 00:18:15.170
Shirogane…

00:18:16.780 --> 00:18:20.380
I can’t believe you would use the Spirit of a human…

00:18:20.380 --> 00:18:24.970
…who can play such a beautiful melody as a weapon!

00:18:24.970 --> 00:18:27.750
Listen to this sound of a pure Spirit!!

00:18:35.730 --> 00:18:36.760
What!?

00:18:37.560 --> 00:18:38.950
The wind is…

00:18:39.770 --> 00:18:40.340
Shirogane!

00:18:41.020 --> 00:18:43.120
Just as I thought…
That thing is still unstable.

00:18:46.240 --> 00:18:47.890
Now, Mew Strawberry!

00:18:47.890 --> 00:18:48.400
Ok!

00:19:05.300 --> 00:19:08.870
Reborn Stawberry… CHECK!!

00:19:13.390 --> 00:19:15.340
PianooooooOOO!

00:19:19.940 --> 00:19:21.030
Retrieve!

00:19:31.990 --> 00:19:34.660
I don’t know what you’re thinking…

00:19:34.660 --> 00:19:36.980
But I won’t let you have it your way!

00:19:36.980 --> 00:19:40.370
Heh, there’s going to be plenty of time to play more.

00:19:40.370 --> 00:19:42.510
I’ll come to play again.

00:19:44.960 --> 00:19:46.170
Ms. Mary!

00:19:46.170 --> 00:19:47.310
Ms. Mary?

00:19:49.470 --> 00:19:50.730
You’re awake!

00:19:55.100 --> 00:19:56.290
Are you okay?

00:20:03.400 --> 00:20:04.640
Shirogane…

00:20:09.700 --> 00:20:10.560
No problem…

00:20:13.870 --> 00:20:16.920
Shirogane… thank you.

00:20:25.370 --> 00:20:27.240
Ball riding, plucky act,
and rotating plates.

00:20:27.240 --> 00:20:29.120
Who is that monkey-like girl?

00:20:29.120 --> 00:20:31.120
Perhaps she’s your relative
or something.

00:20:31.120 --> 00:20:32.250
What’s that supposed to mean, Minto?

00:20:32.250 --> 00:20:36.210
Oh? No one said that you were like a monkey!

00:20:36.210 --> 00:20:38.050
You just did!

00:20:38.050 --> 00:20:40.920
Ichigo! Look at that girl’s ears and tail…!

00:20:40.920 --> 00:20:43.100
What?! She’s a real monkey?

00:20:43.540 --> 00:20:45.060
Next on Tokyo Mew Mew!

00:20:45.060 --> 00:20:48.550
Enter Bu-Ling. The Ears and Tail are Part of the Act.

00:20:48.550 --> 00:20:51.430
For the Earth’s future,
we’ll be of service ~nya!
